# Schema + Model Sync Rule (MANDATORY)

Compulsory, no exceptions. On any new table or column change, update all three in the same change. The task is not done until all three exist; a migration alone is never enough.
1. Migration in `app/Database/Migrations` (guard with `tableExists`/`fieldExists`; master tables go in `TenantEnsureMaster`).
2. `app/Database/Schema/tables.php` (regenerate with `php spark schema:snapshot -tenant <key>`).
3. The Model in `app/Models` with its schema: new table = new Model (`SelfHealingSchema` trait, `$allowedFields`, casts, validation); new column = add to the existing Model's `$allowedFields`.
List the three files touched in the final message.
